            <h3>Youth Empowerment Initiative</h3>
            <p>Provides skills development, mentorship, and leadership workshops to equip young people for the future.</p>
            <p><strong>Target group:</strong> Youth aged 15 to 25.</p>
            <p><strong>Location:</strong> Community centers across Gauteng and Western Cape.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
            <h3>Community Support &amp; Outreach</h3>
            <p>Offers food security assistance, wellness checks, and companionship programs to support vulnerable residents.</p>
            <p><strong>Target group:</strong> The elderly and low-income families.</p>
            <p><strong>Location:</strong> Local township centers and mobile outreach units.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
            <h3>Family Unity Workshops</h3>
            <p>Hosts interactive counseling and activity sessions designed to strengthen family bonds and resolve community challenges.</p>
            <p><strong>Target group:</strong> Families and caregivers.</p>
